cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use wiretruth or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "wiretruth: replaying real LLM provider responses through LLM SDKs"
abstract: >-
  An offline conformance suite that replays recorded LLM provider HTTP responses through LLM SDKs
  and grades whether each SDK reports what actually happened: truncation, finish reasons, usage,
  stream integrity, tool calls, errors and request fidelity.
type: software
authors:
